+// AO4 online coop S2: peer networking between instances. With online_signin, XNet secure
+// addresses are the peers' plain IPv4 addresses (XNADDR.ina = net_bind_ip or the LAN/VPN
+// address), keys always register, QoS probes complete at once and overlapped VDP receives run
+// on a helper thread. Without online_signin the original stubs/failures are kept.
+namespace {
+bool OnlinePeers() { return REX_KERNEL_STATE()->user_profile()->online_signin(); }
